# Deployed build config for the ops-dashboard (internal-zone read-model host).
#
# Endpoint discovery is a BUILD-TIME read of import.meta.env.VITE_DASHBOARD_URL (see
# src/api.ts) — there is no runtime endpoint resource. The P7-9 deploy step sets this
# to the resolved deployed dashboard_server origin, then runs `pnpm --filter
# ops-dashboard build` so the value is baked into the bundle, and `gsutil rsync dist/
# gs://<dashboard_bucket_name>` uploads the assets.
#
# The dashboard is an INTERNAL-zone surface: its bucket is provisioned PRIVATE and
# live internal serving (IAP / internal LB) is a follow-up (design/zones.md). This is
# an EXAMPLE, committed for documentation. Do NOT commit a real .env.production (Vite
# auto-loads it and would bake this placeholder value).
VITE_DASHBOARD_URL=https://<deployed-dashboard-host>
